      <p align="center"><b><font color="#FFFFFF" size="4">Our open contracts</font></b>
      <hr>
      <font size="2"><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=47.topic">Assistance
      Sought Guarding the Peace</a></font>
      <p><font size="2">Hail, Hessians!<br>
      <br>
      I be Gnostik, also known as Pater Gnostik Gnollhugger, Morale Officer fer
      the Champions of the Light. We be a young guild and one focused on
      cementing our standing on Norrath's stage, however we have already become
      embroiled in a matter of honor besmirched with the Order of the White
      Hand.<br>
      <br>
      <!--EZCODE LINK START-->
      <a href="http://pub26.ezboard.com/ftheorderofthewhitehandfrm20.showMessage?topicID=94.topic">pub26.ezboard.com/ftheorderofthewhitehandfrm20.showMessage?topicID=94.topic</a><!--EZCODE LINK END-->
      <br>
      <br>
      <!--EZCODE LINK START-->
      <a href="http://pub52.ezboard.com/farmyoflight12633frm5.showMessage?topicID=12.topic">pub52.ezboard.com/farmyoflight12633frm5.showMessage?topicID=12.topic</a><!--EZCODE LINK END-->
      <br>
      <br>
      Ay've issued a challenge tae them, and now seek tae organize a 6-on-6
      gladiator event between representatives in the Freeport Arena. Of course,
      I suspect many of the inkies will attend in the stands tae jeer, and I
      need tae ensure that hostilities be ... umm ... kept tae a manageable
      minimum. For this, I fear we shall need the assistance of mercenaries such
      as yourself.<br>
      <br>
      I plan tae propose tae the blasted Order that whoever looses the event be
      forced tae pick up the Hessian's fees fer the contract. *sigh* Just the
      kind of contract yer lot lives for, eh?<br>
      <br>
      If this contract works out tae our satisfaction, they will be other work
      for ye as well. Could yer representative contact me at gnostik@radzone.org
      ?</font></p>
      <p><font size="2">Faithfully yours,<br>
      <br>
      Pater Gnostik<br>
      Faithful of Brell Serilis<br>
      Delver of the Undercult<br>
      Morale Officer, Champions of the Light</font></p>
      <hr>
      <p align="center"><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=45.topic"><span class="title"><font size="2"><b>Contract
      sought for aid in War.</b></font></span></a></p>
      <p align="center"><font size="2">Anae,<br>
      <br>
      I seek to hire you for an engagement...nay a War with the Order of the
      White Hand. I would like to speak with you privately about it...I feel our
      ranks, our military could use some enhancement, and your soldiers may fit
      what I have in mind. Please contact me as soon as possible. Or have one of
      your officers contact me. There is much preparation and planning to be
      done, and I need to know what soldiers can be brought to the front, and
      what numbers can mustered.<br>
      <br>
      General Jalyna Valeur, Mark of Draconians</font></p>
      <hr>
      <p align="center">
      
      <span class="title"><font size="2"><b><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=37.topic">A
      new contract</a></b></font></span>
      <p align="center">
      
      <font size="2">*Scroll arrives in the dead of night to the Hessians HQ*<br>
      <br>
      Greetings<br>
      I am Cortusa Rea'Morda and I require your services. Tis but a small matter
      but I need to get hold of fruit, berries and vegetables that grown out in
      the wild. I do not wish to dirty my hands foraging around for them so I
      wish to hire someone to do this for me.<br>
      <br>
      Cortusa Rea'Morda<br>
      First Daughter of Matron Mother Rusalka Rea'Morda<br>
      House Rea'Morda</font>
      <p align="center">
      
      <font size="2">OOC I just need stacks of foraged berries, vegetable and
      fruit for my brewing trade skill. I will discuss quantities and prices
      with whoever you send to me. Thanks</font>
      <hr>
      <p align="center">
      
      <font color="#FFFFFF" size="2"><b><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=15.topic">Looking for a Challenge</a></b><br>
      Greetings Mercenaries<br>
      I am Captain Raynor Stupendous of the Heroic Few. I am looking for a
      challenge. I have slain many in the art of dueling and destruction. I am
      wanting to test my skills. Maybe if one of your members would like to make
      some extra cash (5-10plat) they would like to duel me.<br>
      <br>
      Captain Raynor Stupendous<br>
      <br>
      /ooc just bored, wanted to see what i can do. I am a level 26 Paladin
      looking for someone level 27-29 or 25-26 and i won't use LoH, just a
      little fun <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :) -->
      <img alt=":)" src="http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/smile.gif">
      </font>
